<% if @message.kind == "invitation" -%>
<%= @event.display_host_name %> invited you: <%= @event.title %>
<% elsif @message.kind == "save_the_date" -%>
Save the date! <%= @event.display_host_name %>: <%= @event.title %>
<% else -%>
<%= @message.subject_line %>
<% end -%>

<% if @event.starts_at -%>
When:  <%= event_when(@event) %>
<% end -%>
<% if (place = event_where(@event)).present? -%>
Where: <%= place %>
<% end -%>

Hi <%= @guest.first_name %>,

<% if @message.body.present? -%>
<%= @message.body %>
<% elsif @message.kind == "invitation" -%>
You're invited! Open your invitation to see the details and RSVP.
<% elsif @message.kind == "save_the_date" -%>
Please save the date — a formal invitation will follow.
<% elsif @message.kind == "announcement" -%>
<%= @event.display_host_name %> has news to share with you.
<% elsif @message.kind == "cancellation" -%>
Unfortunately this event has been cancelled.
<% end -%>

Your invitation: <%= @url %>
(This link is personal to you.<% if @event.collects_replies? %> You can use it to change your RSVP later.<% end %>)

--
Sent with Cordially on behalf of <%= @event.display_host_name %>. Reply to reach the host.
Stop messages about this event: <%= @url %> (choose "Stop emails")
